  "updated_at": "2026-03-10",
  "bio": "Carl Munkittrick is a highly skilled traditional tattoo artist based in Sherbrooke, Canada. With a keen eye for detail and a deep respect for the time-honored techniques of traditional tattooing, Carl ensures that every piece he creates is a standout work of art. Clients appreciate his professionalism, which is evident in both the quality of his tattoos and the meticulous cleanliness of his workspace.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Sherbrooke, Quebec, Canada"
}